            "review_title": "Review at Delisa - Fresh Salad Bar HCM",
            "review_text": "Nga Tran\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1794 contributions\n0\nMust try salad!\nMay 2019 • Couples\nI think this place has a special and unique salad. It kinda looks and tastes like western style. I love Ceasar Pasta Salad, it’s easily to try. The other is Avocado Shrimp Pasta Salad, it’s good too but it comes with pesto sauce taste like herb maybe not quite suitable for many people. Small space, not many seat.\nWritten April 8, 2020",
