            "review_title": "Review at Delisa - Fresh Salad Bar HCM",
            "review_text": "AnhDg\nDüsseldorf, Germany2 contributions\n0\n^___^\nJan 2020\nAfter a long day journey I was messed up and tired because of the heat and bustle in HCM. A light dinner is probably the great choice. Finally i decided for Delisa, a tiny salad bar near the downtown. Caesar salad made me really satisfied. Fresh and healthy. \nHighly recommend!\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 2, 2020",
